                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4fb5cde7-be85-3eae-b74f-7ef7beb53d20",
                                        "entry_id": "5d6896ec-02f5-35ab-bfad-c101903aade2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any organism, being or robot with six legs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "785ab897-f66b-4e91-86ac-6417ea0bb784",
                                                "sense_id": "4fb5cde7-be85-3eae-b74f-7ef7beb53d20",
                                                "text": "My lips will be even more firmly sealed about the various suggestions put forward concerning the interpersonal relationships of Alpha Centauri, the hermaphrodite hexapod."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a09f752-0364-4581-ba87-59558d6300fe",
                                                "sense_id": "4fb5cde7-be85-3eae-b74f-7ef7beb53d20",
                                                "text": "The bizarre hexapods did indeed feed upon those unfortunate creatures who had been caught and killed by the flames. But the striped carnivores were not scavengers; They were hunters."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "338b46b6-9b87-4ef2-95fd-834df44a0e73",
                                                "sense_id": "4fb5cde7-be85-3eae-b74f-7ef7beb53d20",
                                                "text": "These concepts are applied to a robotic hexapod, which, through the use of compliant microspines on its feet, is capable of climbing hard vertical textured surfaces, such as stucco"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7b5ddd7-dc31-3b53-9f68-a7a7b67a0c33",
                                        "entry_id": "5d6896ec-02f5-35ab-bfad-c101903aade2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An arthropod with six feet; a member of subphylum Hexapoda."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
